+Money is an integer number of euro cents. `start` and `end` are ISO-8601 UTC strings, and `end` is exclusive.
+A rental of a day or more starts and ends at midnight, so it covers whole days. A rental shorter than a day
+starts and ends on the hour and costs the item's `hourlyPrice` for each hour, with no discount; an item
+without an `hourlyPrice` cannot be rented by the hour, and any other period is disallowed. `quote` and
 `book` throw for an unknown item or a disallowed period; `book` also throws when the item is already
 booked for any part of the period. Booking ids are sequential (`booking-1`, `booking-2`, ...) so that
 behaviour stays deterministic.
